{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_835.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"40177a7d4018ef403faad33ddf10ede6f918aee28fa54874d928eb501a499a38","ja":"和の深遠　触れて見えるは　友の内　","zh":"和的深奥，触碰之后，方能看见朋友的内心","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_835.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d28bf5043463f95d2cb2390801de379a3e8b3adf00ff36a7313613a2d6d7c7f3","ja":"Wow！　なんて素敵な茶室……。\nこれこそ侘び寂びの世界ですね……。","zh":"哇！多么雅致的茶室……。\n这正是侘寂的世界……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_835.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"1b4dea9ed2d095dcc0ee8e9c2bb966eb645e2c08c5f4d02cf941d024e2011d1c","ja":"あっ、丸が書いてある掛け軸があります。\nこれは……どういう意味なのでしょうか？","zh":"啊，这里有一幅画着圆的挂轴。\n这……是什么意思呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_835.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"bf5dba86f2db0af377b0bb9534f8f7286cfaaf1142e989ae6a8b2de210e5e96c","ja":"それは円相ですね～。宇宙、真理などを\n書で表現したものとされています～。","zh":"那就是圆相呢～据说是用书法表现宇宙、真理等事物的作品～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_835.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"0df4aabc9b77601f26a2da976f1df9b3e6416ff969c08d824bdb41302ae3e974","ja":"宇宙、真理を書で表現……すごいです！\n朋花さん、お詳しいんですね♪","zh":"将宇宙和真理用书法表现出来……真厉害！\n朋花小姐，您真是博学多闻呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_835.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"a387b5e319ce1b884e005fc1e6e273cc54761594ffbc81d02702161627e9049b","ja":"母の知り合いに書道家の先生がいまして、\n小さな頃に教えてもらったものですから～。","zh":"我母亲认识一位书法老师，我小时候就是跟她学的～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_835.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"185f27d04e07d0cd3b4bc93ed20a9dad0908476ddf341b7b77bc616848698a86","ja":"あっ、こちらの茶器の方は……\n落ち着いた色合いが渋くて素敵です♪","zh":"啊，这边的茶具嘛……\n沉稳的色调很有韵味，真漂亮♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_835.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"2c14cc07a02af3ca27a2e2fa5c5735cbb04c0b4fce86c71f5d80f9afd92561d8","ja":"これは……たぶん、萩焼ですね。萩の七化けと\n言って、使うごとに色合いが変化していくんです。","zh":"这应该……是萩烧吧。据说萩烧会“七变”，每次使用后色泽都会发生变化。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_835.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"618a48782e023e8350e138a1bd37119fe9cb6906d34f4641309774aa20207001","ja":"萩の七化け……！\n紬さんも、さすがの知識です♪","zh":"萩之七变……！\n纺小姐的知识果然渊博♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_835.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"778a285ae66132c3a720331f8b2407348d4d04de30c73d0a54ef8f2b206c3965","ja":"う、うちも呉服屋の父が詳しいだけで……\nたまたま教えてもらった程度ですから。","zh":"我、我也只是因为父亲是开和服店的，对这方面比较了解……也就是碰巧跟他学过一点而已。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_835.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"49a14022133adba69a52a3c7714373a8817897ca68bace759c35e79900ebb1f2","ja":"おふたりとも、尊敬しちゃいます！\nもっともっと教えて下さい♪","zh":"两位都让我肃然起敬！  \n请再多教教我吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
